syntax tableKeyValueInterface = 
   | `BIN text (from tableKeyValueInterface) 
   | `HEX text (from tableKeyValueInterface) 
   | `DEC text (from tableKeyValueInterface) 
   | text `SLASH nat (from tableKeyValueInterface) 

